# A TyranoBuilder project, of which only what this example authors is
# committed: the project settings and the scene. Everything else — the
# TyranoScript engine and the builder's template (index.html, tyrano/, the rest
# of data/), the plugin, the SpriteStudio source and the packs converted from
# it — `pnpm run setup` puts in place. See README.md.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/package.json
!/README.md
!/README.ja.md
!/scripts/
!/builder_config.json
!/data/
/data/*
!/data/scenario/
/data/scenario/*
!/data/scenario/scene1.ks
